{"format":"mandarin-paket","version":1,"id":"hsk-h3-13","typ":"text","titel":"城市的变化 · Wie sich die Stadt verändert","thema":"HSK 3","beschreibung":"Lesetext HSK 3, 16 Sätze.","saetze":[{"nr":1,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["爷爷","yé ye"],["今年","jīn nián"],["八十","bā shí"],["岁","suì"],["，"],["他","tā"],["在","zài"],["这个","zhè ge"],["城市","chéng shì"],["住","zhù"],["了","le"],["八十","bā shí"],["年","nián"],["。"]],"de":"Mein Grossvater ist achtzig und hat sein ganzes Leben in dieser Stadt gewohnt.","audio":"audio/01.mp3","langsam":"audio/01-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":2,"w":[["他","Tā"],["经常","jīng cháng"],["给","gěi"],["我","wǒ"],["讲","jiǎng"],["以前","yǐ qián"],["的","de"],["故事","gù shì"],["。"]],"de":"Er erzählt mir oft Geschichten von früher.","audio":"audio/02.mp3","langsam":"audio/02-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":3,"w":[["他","Tā"],["说","shuō"],["，"],["五十","wǔ shí"],["年","nián"],["前","qián"],["，"],["这里","zhè li"],["没有","méi yǒu"],["高","gāo"],["楼","lóu"],["，"],["也","yě"],["没有","méi yǒu"],["地铁","dì tiě"],["。"]],"de":"Er sagt, vor fünfzig Jahren habe es hier keine Hochhäuser und keine U-Bahn gegeben.","audio":"audio/03.mp3","langsam":"audio/03-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":4,"w":[["那时候","Nà shí hou"],["，"],["街道","jiē dào"],["上","shàng"],["的","de"],["车","chē"],["很","hěn"],["少","shǎo"],["，"],["大家","dà jiā"],["都","dōu"],["骑","qí"],["自行车","zì xíng chē"],["。"]],"de":"Damals gab es auf den Strassen wenige Autos, alle fuhren Velo.","audio":"audio/04.mp3","langsam":"audio/04-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":5,"w":[["人们","Rén men"],["住","zhù"],["在","zài"],["很","hěn"],["小","xiǎo"],["的","de"],["房子","fáng zi"],["里","lǐ"],["，"],["家","jiā"],["里","lǐ"],["没有","méi yǒu"],["冰箱","bīng xiāng"],["，"],["也","yě"],["没有","méi yǒu"],["空调","kōng tiáo"],["。"]],"de":"Die Leute wohnten in kleinen Häusern ohne Kühlschrank und ohne Klimaanlage.","audio":"audio/05.mp3","langsam":"audio/05-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":6,"w":[["夏天","Xià tiān"],["特别","tè bié"],["热","rè"],["的","de"],["时候","shí hou"],["，"],["他们","tā men"],["晚上","wǎn shang"],["就","jiù"],["在","zài"],["外面","wài mian"],["睡觉","shuì jiào"],["。"]],"de":"Wenn es im Sommer besonders heiss war, schliefen sie nachts draussen.","audio":"audio/06.mp3","langsam":"audio/06-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":7,"w":[["现在","Xiàn zài"],["，"],["城市","chéng shì"],["的","de"],["变化","biàn huà"],["非常","fēi cháng"],["大","dà"],["。"]],"de":"Heute hat sich die Stadt sehr verändert.","audio":"audio/07.mp3","langsam":"audio/07-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":8,"w":[["城市","Chéng shì"],["里","lǐ"],["有","yǒu"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["高","gāo"],["楼","lóu"],["，"],["街道","jiē dào"],["上","shàng"],["有","yǒu"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["汽车","qì chē"],["。"]],"de":"Überall stehen Hochhäuser, und auf den Strassen fahren viele Autos.","audio":"audio/08.mp3","langsam":"audio/08-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":9,"w":[["超市","Chāo shì"],["、"],["银行","yín háng"],["、"],["饭馆","fàn guǎn"],["都","dōu"],["在","zài"],["家","jiā"],["的","de"],["附近","fù jìn"],["，"],["买","mǎi"],["东西","dōng xi"],["很","hěn"],["方便","fāng biàn"],["。"]],"de":"Supermärkte, Banken und Restaurants sind ganz in der Nähe, Einkaufen ist sehr bequem.","audio":"audio/09.mp3","langsam":"audio/09-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":10,"w":[["爷爷","Yé ye"],["说","shuō"],["，"],["现在","xiàn zài"],["比","bǐ"],["以前","yǐ qián"],["好","hǎo"],["多","duō"],["了","le"],["。"]],"de":"Grossvater sagt, heute sei vieles besser als früher.","audio":"audio/10.mp3","langsam":"audio/10-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":11,"w":[["但是","Dàn shì"],["他","tā"],["也","yě"],["有","yǒu"],["不","bù"],["满意","mǎn yì"],["的","de"],["地方","dì fang"],["。"]],"de":"Aber es gibt auch Dinge, mit denen er nicht zufrieden ist.","audio":"audio/11.mp3","langsam":"audio/11-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":12,"w":[["他","Tā"],["说","shuō"],["，"],["以前","yǐ qián"],["的","de"],["天","tiān"],["更","gèng"],["蓝","lán"],["，"],["河","hé"],["里","lǐ"],["的","de"],["水","shuǐ"],["也","yě"],["更","gèng"],["干净","gān jìng"],["。"]],"de":"Er sagt, früher sei der Himmel blauer und das Wasser im Fluss sauberer gewesen.","audio":"audio/12.mp3","langsam":"audio/12-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":13,"w":[["以前","Yǐ qián"],["邻居","lín jū"],["们","men"],["的","de"],["关系","guān xi"],["很","hěn"],["好","hǎo"],["，"],["经常","jīng cháng"],["一起","yì qǐ"],["吃饭","chī fàn"],["、"],["说话","shuō huà"],["。"]],"de":"Früher hätten sich die Nachbarn gut verstanden und oft zusammen gegessen und geplaudert.","audio":"audio/13.mp3","langsam":"audio/13-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":14,"w":[["现在","Xiàn zài"],["大家","dà jiā"],["都","dōu"],["很","hěn"],["忙","máng"],["，"],["住","zhù"],["在","zài"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["楼","lóu"],["里","lǐ"],["也","yě"],["不","bú"],["认识","rèn shi"],["。"]],"de":"Heute seien alle beschäftigt und kennten sich nicht einmal im selben Haus.","audio":"audio/14.mp3","langsam":"audio/14-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":15,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["觉得","jué de"],["爷爷","yé ye"],["说","shuō"],["得","de"],["很","hěn"],["对","duì"],["。"]],"de":"Ich finde, Grossvater hat recht.","audio":"audio/15.mp3","langsam":"audio/15-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":16,"w":[["城市","Chéng shì"],["变化","biàn huà"],["得","de"],["越来越","yuè lái yuè"],["快","kuài"],["，"],["我们","wǒ men"],["也","yě"],["应该","yīng gāi"],["注意","zhù yì"],["环境","huán jìng"],["，"],["多","duō"],["关心","guān xīn"],["我们","wǒ men"],["的","de"],["邻居","lín jū"],["。"]],"de":"Die Stadt verändert sich immer schneller, wir sollten auf die Umwelt achten und uns mehr um unsere Nachbarn kümmern.","audio":"audio/16.mp3","langsam":"audio/16-langsam2.mp3"}],"woerter":{"我":{"py":"Wǒ","art":"Pron","de":"ich","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild einer Hellebarde (Waffe 戈 mit gezackter Klinge). Wurde wegen des gleichen Lauts für «ich» entlehnt.","audio":"audio/w/1.mp3"},"爷爷":{"py":"yé ye","art":"N","de":"Grossvater (väterlicherseits)","herl":"父 Vater + 耶 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/2.mp3"},"今年":{"py":"jīn nián","art":"N","de":"dieses Jahr","herl":"今 jetzt + 年 Jahr.","audio":"audio/w/3.mp3"},"八十":{"py":"bā shí","art":"Zahl","de":"achtzig","herl":"八 acht + 十 zehn.","audio":"audio/w/4.mp3"},"岁":{"py":"suì","art":"ZW","de":"Jahre (Alter)","herl":"Nach der Zahl: 二十岁. Bei Altersangaben fällt 是 weg.","audio":"audio/w/5.mp3"},"他":{"py":"tā","art":"Pron","de":"er","herl":"亻 Mensch + 也 (Lautteil). Gleich ausgesprochen wie 她 sie und 它 es.","audio":"audio/w/6.mp3"},"在":{"py":"zài","art":"V/Präp","de":"sich befinden; in, an; gerade (tun)","herl":"Ortsangabe steht vor dem Verb: 在学校工作. Vor Verben auch «gerade»: 我在看书.","audio":"audio/w/7.mp3"},"这个":{"py":"zhè ge","art":"Pron","de":"dieser, diese, dieses","herl":"这 dies + 个 Zählwort. Gegenteil: 那个 jenes.","audio":"audio/w/8.mp3"},"城市":{"py":"chéng shì","art":"N","de":"Stadt","herl":"城 Stadtmauer + 市 Markt.","audio":"audio/w/9.mp3"},"住":{"py":"zhù","art":"V","de":"wohnen","herl":"亻 Mensch + 主 (Lautteil): wo ein Mensch bleibt.","audio":"audio/w/10.mp3"},"了":{"py":"le","art":"Part","de":"(abgeschlossene Handlung, Veränderung)","herl":"Nach dem Verb: Handlung ist geschehen (我买了). Am Satzende: neue Lage (下雨了 = jetzt regnet es).","audio":"audio/w/11.mp3"},"年":{"py":"nián","art":"N","de":"Jahr","herl":"Ursprünglich Mensch mit Getreide: die jährliche Ernte.","audio":"audio/w/12.mp3"},"经常":{"py":"jīng cháng","art":"Adv","de":"oft","herl":"经 regelmässig + 常 häufig.","audio":"audio/w/13.mp3"},"给":{"py":"gěi","art":"V/Präp","de":"geben; für","herl":"纟 Faden + 合 (Lautteil). 给我 = mir; 给她做饭 = für sie kochen.","audio":"audio/w/14.mp3"},"讲":{"py":"jiǎng","art":"V","de":"erzählen, erklären","herl":"讠 Rede + 井 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/15.mp3"},"以前":{"py":"yǐ qián","art":"N","de":"früher, vorher","herl":"以 + 前 vorn. 来中国以前 = bevor ich nach China kam.","audio":"audio/w/16.mp3"},"的":{"py":"de","art":"Part","de":"Besitz- und Attributpartikel («-s», «von»)","herl":"白 weiss + 勺 Löffel; ursprünglich «hell, klar». Heute grammatisch: 我的 = mein, 好吃的菜 = feines Essen.","audio":"audio/w/17.mp3"},"故事":{"py":"gù shì","art":"N","de":"Geschichte, Erzählung","herl":"故 alt + 事 Sache.","audio":"audio/w/18.mp3"},"说":{"py":"shuō","art":"V","de":"sagen, sprechen","herl":"讠 Rede + 兑 (Lautteil). 说汉语 = Chinesisch sprechen.","audio":"audio/w/19.mp3"},"五十":{"py":"wǔ shí","art":"Zahl","de":"fünfzig","herl":"五 fünf + 十 zehn.","audio":"audio/w/20.mp3"},"前":{"py":"qián","art":"Ortswort","de":"vorn; vor (Zeit)","herl":"十年前 = vor zehn Jahren.","audio":"audio/w/21.mp3"},"这里":{"py":"zhè li","art":"Pron","de":"hier","herl":"这 dies + 里 Ort.","audio":"audio/w/22.mp3"},"没有":{"py":"méi yǒu","art":"V/Adv","de":"nicht haben; es gibt nicht; nicht (Vergangenheit)","herl":"没 + 有.","audio":"audio/w/23.mp3"},"高":{"py":"gāo","art":"Adj","de":"hoch, gross","herl":"Bild eines hohen Turms.","audio":"audio/w/24.mp3"},"楼":{"py":"lóu","art":"N","de":"Gebäude, Haus mit Stockwerken","herl":"木 Holz + 娄 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/25.mp3"},"也":{"py":"yě","art":"Adv","de":"auch","herl":"Steht immer vor dem Verb: 我也喜欢.","audio":"audio/w/26.mp3"},"地铁":{"py":"dì tiě","art":"N","de":"U-Bahn","herl":"地 Erde + 铁 Eisen: «Eisenbahn unter der Erde».","audio":"audio/w/27.mp3"},"那时候":{"py":"Nà shí hou","art":"N","de":"damals","herl":"那 + 时候 Zeit.","audio":"audio/w/28.mp3"},"街道":{"py":"jiē dào","art":"N","de":"Strasse","herl":"街 Strasse + 道 Weg.","audio":"audio/w/29.mp3"},"上":{"py":"shàng","art":"Ortswort/V","de":"auf, oben; vorig; hinaufgehen","herl":"Strich über der Grundlinie. 桌子上 = auf dem Tisch, 上个月 = letzten Monat.","audio":"audio/w/30.mp3"},"车":{"py":"chē","art":"N","de":"Wagen, Auto, Fahrzeug","herl":"Bild eines Wagens von oben.","audio":"audio/w/31.mp3"},"很":{"py":"hěn","art":"Adv","de":"sehr","herl":"Vor Adjektiven oft nur Bindeglied: 天气很好 = Das Wetter ist gut.","audio":"audio/w/32.mp3"},"少":{"py":"shǎo","art":"Adj","de":"wenig","herl":"小 klein + 丿: noch weniger.","audio":"audio/w/33.mp3"},"大家":{"py":"dà jiā","art":"Pron","de":"alle","herl":"大 gross + 家 Familie: «die grosse Familie».","audio":"audio/w/34.mp3"},"都":{"py":"dōu","art":"Adv","de":"alle, beide; schon","herl":"Fasst das vorher Genannte zusammen: 我们都喜欢 = wir mögen es alle.","audio":"audio/w/35.mp3"},"骑":{"py":"qí","art":"V","de":"reiten, Velo fahren","herl":"马 Pferd + 奇 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/36.mp3"},"自行车":{"py":"zì xíng chē","art":"N","de":"Velo, Fahrrad","herl":"自 selbst + 行 fahren + 车 Wagen.","audio":"audio/w/37.mp3"},"人们":{"py":"Rén men","art":"N","de":"die Leute","herl":"人 + 们.","audio":"audio/w/38.mp3"},"小":{"py":"xiǎo","art":"Adj","de":"klein; jung","herl":"Drei kleine Punkte. Vor Namen vertraulich: 小王.","audio":"audio/w/39.mp3"},"房子":{"py":"fáng zi","art":"N","de":"Haus, Wohnung","herl":"房 Haus + 子.","audio":"audio/w/40.mp3"},"里":{"py":"lǐ","art":"Ortswort","de":"in, drinnen","herl":"Nach dem Nomen: 商店里 = im Laden.","audio":"audio/w/41.mp3"},"家":{"py":"jiā","art":"N","de":"Familie, Zuhause; ZW für Firmen","herl":"宀 Dach + 豕 Schwein: ein Haus mit Vieh galt als Heim. 在家 = zu Hause.","audio":"audio/w/42.mp3"},"冰箱":{"py":"bīng xiāng","art":"N","de":"Kühlschrank","herl":"冰 Eis + 箱 Kiste.","audio":"audio/w/43.mp3"},"空调":{"py":"kōng tiáo","art":"N","de":"Klimaanlage","herl":"空 Luft + 调 regeln.","audio":"audio/w/44.mp3"},"夏天":{"py":"Xià tiān","art":"N","de":"Sommer","herl":"夏 + 天.","audio":"audio/w/45.mp3"},"特别":{"py":"tè bié","art":"Adv/Adj","de":"besonders","herl":"特 besonders + 别 anders.","audio":"audio/w/46.mp3"},"热":{"py":"rè","art":"Adj","de":"heiss, warm","herl":"灬 Feuer unten im Zeichen.","audio":"audio/w/47.mp3"},"时候":{"py":"shí hou","art":"N","de":"Zeit, Zeitpunkt","herl":"…的时候 = als…, wenn…: 下雨的时候.","audio":"audio/w/48.mp3"},"他们":{"py":"tā men","art":"Pron","de":"sie (Mehrzahl)","herl":"他 er + 们.","audio":"audio/w/49.mp3"},"晚上":{"py":"wǎn shang","art":"N","de":"Abend","herl":"晚 spät + 上.","audio":"audio/w/50.mp3"},"就":{"py":"jiù","art":"Adv","de":"schon, gleich; genau","herl":"Betont Schnelligkeit oder Folge: 十分钟就到了 = in nur zehn Minuten da.","audio":"audio/w/51.mp3"},"外面":{"py":"wài mian","art":"Ortswort","de":"draussen","herl":"外 aussen + 面 Seite.","audio":"audio/w/52.mp3"},"睡觉":{"py":"shuì jiào","art":"V","de":"schlafen","herl":"睡 schlafen (目 Auge + 垂 herabhängen) + 觉 Schlaf.","audio":"audio/w/53.mp3"},"现在":{"py":"Xiàn zài","art":"N","de":"jetzt","herl":"现 erscheinen + 在 sein: «was gerade da ist».","audio":"audio/w/54.mp3"},"变化":{"py":"biàn huà","art":"N/V","de":"Veränderung; sich verändern","herl":"变 ändern + 化 verwandeln.","audio":"audio/w/55.mp3"},"非常":{"py":"fēi cháng","art":"Adv","de":"sehr, äusserst","herl":"非 nicht + 常 gewöhnlich: «aussergewöhnlich».","audio":"audio/w/56.mp3"},"大":{"py":"dà","art":"Adj","de":"gross; alt (Alter)","herl":"Mensch mit ausgebreiteten Armen. 比我大 = älter als ich.","audio":"audio/w/57.mp3"},"有":{"py":"yǒu","art":"V","de":"haben; es gibt","herl":"Hand 𠂇 hält ein Stück Fleisch (月 = 肉): etwas besitzen. Verneint mit 没: 没有.","audio":"audio/w/58.mp3"},"多":{"py":"duō","art":"Adj","de":"viel, viele; mehr","herl":"Zwei 夕 (Abend) übereinander: «viele Abende». 多吃 = mehr essen.","audio":"audio/w/59.mp3"},"汽车":{"py":"qì chē","art":"N","de":"Auto","herl":"汽 Dampf + 车 Wagen.","audio":"audio/w/60.mp3"},"超市":{"py":"Chāo shì","art":"N","de":"Supermarkt","herl":"超 übertreffen + 市 Markt: Kurzform von 超级市场.","audio":"audio/w/61.mp3"},"银行":{"py":"yín háng","art":"N","de":"Bank","herl":"银 Silber + 行 Geschäft.","audio":"audio/w/62.mp3"},"饭馆":{"py":"fàn guǎn","art":"N","de":"Restaurant","herl":"饭 Essen + 馆 Gebäude, Lokal.","audio":"audio/w/63.mp3"},"附近":{"py":"fù jìn","art":"N","de":"Nähe, in der Nähe","herl":"附 angrenzen + 近 nah.","audio":"audio/w/64.mp3"},"买":{"py":"mǎi","art":"V","de":"kaufen","herl":"3. Ton. Achtung: 卖 mài (4. Ton) heisst verkaufen.","audio":"audio/w/65.mp3"},"东西":{"py":"dōng xi","art":"N","de":"Sachen, Dinge","herl":"东 Osten + 西 Westen: «alles von Ost bis West». 买东西 = einkaufen.","audio":"audio/w/66.mp3"},"方便":{"py":"fāng biàn","art":"Adj","de":"praktisch, bequem","herl":"方 Richtung + 便 bequem.","audio":"audio/w/67.mp3"},"比":{"py":"bǐ","art":"Präp","de":"als (Vergleich)","herl":"Zwei Menschen nebeneinander: vergleichen. A比B贵 = A ist teurer als B.","audio":"audio/w/68.mp3"},"好":{"py":"hǎo","art":"Adj","de":"gut; gern, einverstanden","herl":"女 Frau + 子 Kind: Mutter mit Kind steht für «gut». Als Antwort: «Einverstanden!»","audio":"audio/w/69.mp3"},"但是":{"py":"Dàn shì","art":"Konj","de":"aber","herl":"但 nur + 是.","audio":"audio/w/70.mp3"},"不":{"py":"bù","art":"Adv","de":"nicht","herl":"Ton wechselt: vor 4. Ton bú (不去), sonst bù.","audio":"audio/w/71.mp3"},"满意":{"py":"mǎn yì","art":"Adj","de":"zufrieden","herl":"满 voll + 意 Sinn.","audio":"audio/w/72.mp3"},"地方":{"py":"dì fang","art":"N","de":"Ort, Stelle","herl":"地 Boden + 方 Richtung.","audio":"audio/w/73.mp3"},"天":{"py":"tiān","art":"N","de":"Tag; Himmel","herl":"Mensch 大 mit Strich darüber: der Himmel über dem Kopf.","audio":"audio/w/74.mp3"},"更":{"py":"gèng","art":"Adv","de":"noch mehr","herl":"更多 = noch mehr, 更好 = noch besser.","audio":"audio/w/75.mp3"},"蓝":{"py":"lán","art":"Adj","de":"blau","herl":"艹 Pflanze + 监: aus Indigo-Pflanzen.","audio":"audio/w/76.mp3"},"河":{"py":"hé","art":"N","de":"Fluss","herl":"氵 Wasser + 可 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/77.mp3"},"水":{"py":"shuǐ","art":"N","de":"Wasser","herl":"Bild eines fliessenden Baches.","audio":"audio/w/78.mp3"},"干净":{"py":"gān jìng","art":"Adj","de":"sauber","herl":"干 trocken + 净 rein.","audio":"audio/w/79.mp3"},"邻居":{"py":"lín jū","art":"N","de":"Nachbar","herl":"邻 benachbart + 居 wohnen.","audio":"audio/w/80.mp3"},"们":{"py":"men","art":"Suffix","de":"(Mehrzahl bei Personen)","herl":"亻 Mensch + 门 (Lautteil). 孩子们 = die Kinder.","audio":"audio/w/81.mp3"},"关系":{"py":"guān xi","art":"N","de":"Beziehung","herl":"关 verbinden + 系 Faden.","audio":"audio/w/82.mp3"},"一起":{"py":"yì qǐ","art":"Adv","de":"zusammen","herl":"一 eins + 起 aufstehen: «gemeinsam».","audio":"audio/w/83.mp3"},"吃饭":{"py":"chī fàn","art":"V","de":"essen, eine Mahlzeit einnehmen","herl":"吃 essen + 饭 Mahlzeit.","audio":"audio/w/84.mp3"},"说话":{"py":"shuō huà","art":"V","de":"sprechen, reden","herl":"说 sagen + 话 Worte.","audio":"audio/w/85.mp3"},"忙":{"py":"máng","art":"Adj","de":"beschäftigt","herl":"忄 Herz + 亡 verloren: «das Herz verlieren».","audio":"audio/w/86.mp3"},"一":{"py":"yí","art":"Zahl","de":"eins, ein","herl"